<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bond trade closed for Easter.</title>
<headline>Swiss bond trade closed for Easter.</headline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Swiss cash bonds and debt futures remains closed on Friday, March 28 and Monday, March 31 for the Easter holiday. Trade will resume on Tuesday, April 1.</p>
<p>Prices ended higher Thursday on good demand for the Swiss Treasury's latest government bond auction.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
